AUDIO: 'avatar doesn\'t have to do that either. I say we give your avatar an actual wardrobe. Using AI to design new looks, reference photos to get specific, and a method for adding more source material that makes your avatar perform better'

[00:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'overall. Let\'s get into it. I\'m Marie Lomand and this is starting with HeyGen. Quick vocabulary before we touch anything. A look is a visual variation of your avatar. Same face, same voice, same person. Different setting,'

[00:38] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'different outfit, different vibe. Your looks all live in your avatar\'s library and you can build plenty. If you just made your clone, you probably have one look right now. Don\'t worry, that is where everyone starts. Let me show you'

