VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'you a closer result. Give yourself a couple of rounds if you need them. Before we leave, take a look at this section below the prompt area, the look packs. Pre-built look environments you can remix onto your avatar. Office interview, podcast studio, presentation'

[04:23] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'room, fitness. Each one has multiple looks inside it. Podcast studio has five looks in this pack. Different angles, different lighting, all in the same environment. You browse, you find one'

[04:35] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'that fits, hit remix looks, and HeyGen applies it to your avatar. Look packs are fast. The describe plus references path gets you specific. They work well together. Use whichever fits what you\'re looking to build or do both if you want.'

[04:48] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'One last thing, you now have the tools to build a full wardrobe, which means you could, theoretically, use a completely different look every single video. But what I suggest is picking a few really strong ones to rotate'

[05:01] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'through. Use those consistently so your audience builds recognition. Then, use other looks intentionally for specific series, for specific platform, a specific reason. 54 looks does not mean you need to have 54 different'

